DESCRIPTION = """Steam-only Tex Murphy: Overseer compatibility patcher (App ID 302370).

Standard-library-only. Tested asset signatures are deliberately fixed; an
unknown game build is rejected instead of guessed at. Run with Steam closed
for apply/revert so Steam does not overwrite its compatibility mapping.
"""

